Description: A research-centred Shiny interface and reproducible console API
    for importing, validating, preparing, grouping, analysing, visualising,
    and exporting personal light exposure data with 'LightLogR'. Analyses are
    represented as versioned recipes, can be saved as local project bundles,
    and can be extended with startup-provided Shiny analysis modules.
